Verify fix for bug {{.key}}: "{{.title}}".

SEVERITY: {{.severity}}

READ:
(1) Bug report at {{.file_path}} — the original reproduction steps and expected behavior
(2) Bug notes (shark bug notes {{.key}}) — the developer's fix description

VERIFY:
(1) Follow the original reproduction steps — confirm the bug no longer occurs
(2) Confirm the expected behavior now works correctly
(3) Run relevant tests: look for tests related to this bug
(4) Check for regressions in adjacent functionality

ROUTE:
- Fix verified and working → shark bug note {{.key}} 'VERIFIED: {how it was verified}' then shark status set {{.key}} resolved
- Fix incomplete or new issues found → shark bug note {{.key}} 'VERIFICATION_FAILED: {what still fails}' then shark status set {{.key}} in_fix
